📖 Steps to Access & Download Project Source Code
---

The complete source code for this project is hosted directly within this repository as a compressed **ZIP package**.

Follow these simple steps to download and extract the project files to your local machine:

1. Locate the ZIP File: Navigate to the main root folder of this GitHub repository and click on the `project-code.zip` file (or `Code.zip`).
2. Download the File: Click the **Raw** button located at the top-right corner of the file preview window to download the complete ZIP package instantly.
3. Extract the Contents: 
   - Open your local Downloads folder.
   - Right-click the downloaded .zip archive and select Extract All... (Windows) or double-click it (macOS / Linux).
4. Open in IDE: Launch your preferred IDE (e.g., IntelliJ IDEA, VS Code or Eclipse) and open the newly extracted project folder.

--------------------------------------------------------
> 💡 **Tip:** Alternatively, if you have Git installed, you can clone the entire repository directly using:
> bash
> git clone YOUR_GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL
> 
